SUMMARY:Impromptu LV New Holland Coffee Company (30R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader CP Weaver\nPa
 ce between 14-16 mph\nThis ride is a social ride\, but cyclists are not ex
 pected to stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable p
 aces. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone biking al
 one or being dropped off the back of the last group.\nIf anyone is up for 
 it we can either stop at the coffee stop or continue straight through and 
 drive over to grab lunch at Mick's All American Pub located in the complex
  at penn cinema post ride.\n\nhttps://www.micksallamericanpub.com/\n\nCue 
 and Ride with GPS links:\nhttps://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lv-new-
 holland-coffee-company-30r/\nHelmets are mandatory\; please also plan to b
 ring 1-2 water bottles\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\
 , pump/CO2 inflator).\nBeing a Meetup Member does not mean you are a club 
 member. Use this link to join the club.\n[https://www.lancasterbikeclub.ne
 t/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.ne
 t/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to 
 abide by the club's Code of Conduct [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/
 content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikec
