SUMMARY:Thursday Evening Special 26R (A+) (22-24mph)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n25-ish mile flat *rolling
 * route.\nThe route is the same each week.\n\nFor the experienced group ri
 der in good physical condition and capable of maintaining a steady pace. F
 ew stops if any. Riders unable to maintain classified pace may be dropped.
  If unsure if this ride is for you\, it is recommended you try the "A" rid
 e option first\, which leaves from the same location a few minutes later.\
 n\nCue sheet and GPX files: [https://ridewithgps.com/routes/42866619](http
