SUMMARY:Impromptu: LC Landis Valley Ride (18R) Start: Lancaster Catholic H
 igh School
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nHybrid ride 11-12-13 mph.
  Re-grouping stops as needed.\n\nRide leader: Jon Hartung\nSweep: Ann Morr
 is\n\nAnticipated Average Pace: 11-12-13 mph\n\nRoute: [https://routes.lan
 casterbikeclub.net/cue/lc-landis-valley-ride-18r/](https://routes.lancaste
 rbikeclub.net/cue/lc-landis-valley-ride-18r/)\n\nThe ride leader will ride
  at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with
  a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to 
 keep the group together with occasional regroupings and a sweeper may also
  be appointed at the start. Please do not join this ride if you are not wi
 lling to ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be 
 riding by yourself and encouraged to join a faster group.\n\nIf maintainin
 g a 11-12-13 mph average is beyond your current ability level\, please con
 sider joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. P
 lease bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/
 CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we 
 require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being
  on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here Member Signup Yo
 ur RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: Code of 
 Conduct Guidance if an incident occurs: Incident Actions
